<title>USA: Los Angeles $87.5 mln COPs won by BA at 5.1548 pct.</title>
<headline>Los Angeles $87.5 mln COPs won by BA at 5.1548 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BA Securities said Tuesday it won $87.5 million Los Angeles certificates of participation at a true interest cost of 5.1548 percent.</p>
</text>
